<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, DEC 16.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, DEC 16.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Monday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Dec 16	Dec 13	DEC 29 95    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  245.100     243.870     237.040    3.40 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  304.630     304.600     303.640    0.33 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  157.665     158.050     165.490   -4.73 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.728	46.774	48.410   -3.47 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  406.780     403.760     366.280   11.06 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.555     140.895     147.886   -4.96 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.021	16.981	14.975    6.98 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  215.380     215.840     230.135   -6.41 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.875	 1.877	 1.939   -3.30 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.565	 1.564	 1.575   -0.63 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  184.750     185.915     206.030   -4.50 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>29, 1995 rate.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
